a_{21}&=a_1+(21-1)d\\
&=1+(21-1)9\\
&=1+20\cdot 9\\
&=1+180\\
&=181
\end{align*} Therefore, the value of the 21st term is $\boxed{181}$. </think> <answer> 181 </answer>

